gic_v3.h's SGI/PPI pending and config functions use the distributor even with
affinity routing on; mdrivlib's imx8mn_ca53 target works around that (drivers/interrupt_control.hh).

MetaModule changes (so the headers compile as C++ too, since MIMX8MN6_ca53.h always includes them):
- gic_v3.h: explicit casts on GIC_GetRdistSGIBase() results and GIC_SetGroup()'s IRQn argument.
- cmsis_gcc.h: spaces between string literals and __STRINGIFY() in __MSR/__MRS (-Wliteral-suffix).
